  "bio": "Frank Statuto stands out in the world of ink with expert craftsmanship in dotwork, lettering, and anime-inspired tattoos. Their attention to detail and adept knowledge in the art of black and gray dotwork make them a sought-after tattoo artist in Lecce, Italy. Whether it's a delicate pattern or an intricate design, clients leave Frank Statuto's studio with uniquely tailored artwork that truly represents their personal style.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lecce, Apulia, Italy"
